msgstr "Östäldäge tamğalar öçen totılğan."

#: fonts.cpp:588
msgid "Ad&just All Fonts..."
msgstr "Bar Yazularnı &Köyläw..."

#: fonts.cpp:589
msgid "Click to change all fonts"
msgstr "Bar yazularnı üzgärtü öçen çirt"

#: fonts.cpp:596
msgid "Use a&nti-aliasing for fonts"
msgstr "Yazular şomartuın &qullanası"

#: fonts.cpp:597
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDE will smooth the edges of curves in fonts."
msgstr "Bu köylämä yanıq torsa, KDE yazular çiklären şomartıp toraçaq."

#: fonts.cpp:600
msgid "Configure..."
msgstr "Caylaw..."

#: fonts.cpp:676
msgid ""
"<p>You have changed anti-aliasing related settings. This change will only "
"affect newly started applications.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Şomartu köyläwläre üzgärtelgän bulğan. Yaña cibärelgän yazılımnarda ğına "
"alarnıñ çağılışı bulaçaq.</p>"

#: fonts.cpp:677
msgid "Anti-Aliasing Settings Changed"
msgstr "Yazular Şomartu Caylawı Üzgärelgän"

